{
  "title": "Yellow Earthy American Beetroot Hash",
  "description": "A rich and shaggy American dish featuring beetroot, perfect for a quick fix, and flexitarian-friendly. This recipe combines the earthy sweetness of beetroot with the comfort of a hash.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "diet": [
    "flexitarian",
